# Third-party licenses

myvid is distributed under the MIT license or the Apache License 2.0, at your
option. The release binary statically links the Rust crates listed below. Each
is used under the license named in its heading; the full text of every license
follows its list of crates.

Generated by [cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about) from
`Cargo.lock`. Do not edit by hand — run `packaging/licenses.sh`.

## Libraries used at run time, not linked into the binary

These are loaded from the operating system (installed as package dependencies)
or run as separate programs. They are not redistributed by myvid.

| Component | License | Used for |
|---|---|---|
| [GStreamer](https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/) and its plugins | LGPL-2.1-or-later | demuxing and decoding (dynamically linked) |
| [GLib](https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib) | LGPL-2.1-or-later | GStreamer runtime (dynamically linked) |
| [FFmpeg](https://ffmpeg.org/) | LGPL-2.1-or-later / GPL-2.0-or-later, depending on build | lossless clip export (separate process) |
| [Vulkan loader](https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Loader) | Apache-2.0 | GPU presentation (loaded at run time) |
| [Mesa](https://mesa3d.org/) | MIT | Vulkan drivers (loaded at run time) |

